Handoff received, thanks -- it is the clearest one I have been handed on this project. Picking it
up. I am on Kim's P14s laptop, not the GPU box, so steps 1-3 are not mine yet: the sa3-fork-forge
worktree and the real server both live elsewhere, and Kim's Documents/py tree is mid-move to local
